oman name Aphrodite is Greek 🫩 either Eros and Aphrodite or Cupid and Venus", "timestamp": 1793321846, "like_count": 58}, {"author": "delta_sam.z", "author_id": "51947738020", "id": "18096577925150432", "text": "Wait did I actually miss an episode? I know I was busy but the algorithm failing me wasn't on my bingo", "timestamp": 1793312074, "like_count": 6}, {"author": "mosieyb", "author_id": "791010748", "id": "18383578057234438", "text": "Since every tag is on the wrong bag (because Aphrodite doesn’t lie), then you take one grain from the bag labelled mixed grain. Mixed grain bag has to be either wheat or barley, so if the grain you pick is wheat, this means - 1) mixed labelled bag is the wheat bag 2) the bag labelled barley must be mixed (it can’t be barley because all tags are wrong) 3) the bag labelled wheat is barley.", "timestamp": 1793300081, "like_count": 83}, {"author": "isseixixi", "author_id": "38260342870", "id": "17913453936515548", "text": "Tooo earlyyy", "timestamp": 1793277336, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfEUSTcK1Lf/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfEUSTcK1Lf", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/875937431_18145737523570984_1980510853389939874_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAxODQyNTk4NjI3NTgyNDM1MQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=wS8UyNdVXF0Q7kNvwF_q8Lf&_nc_oc=Ado6S1L2oPSFdXoSGN28frSKdxUZu-NIyDlwRCGZ2w7Lsb8WYb_ObSR45mRiK1i-sxWPwHJZ4bMbcuuWR70_KkTN&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna&_nc_gid=dVd5oMiR-ExQNgrqP0vpTw&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQQs6s8Id1cYHVb43nQ935T3FxU62NK7rLze7zJT1EugaA&oe=6AF81D5F", "display_id": "DfEUSTcK1Lf", "fulltitle": "Video by mythospaths", "upload_date": "20261029", "epoch": 1794267179, "format": "dash-16528056297